  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistical Support to the Norwegian Election Observer Group to the EU Election Observation Mission (EU EOM) for the General Elections in Lebanon 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Commission/Foreign Policy Instrument 3 (FPI 3) appointed the International Organization for Migration (IOM with the logistical and administrative implementation of the European Union Election Observation Mission (EU EOM) for the 2022 General Elections in Lebanon. In accordance with the terms of reference of the EU EOM Lebanon 2022, IOM will provide logistical and administrative support to one Norwegian Election Observer (non-EU), who is a member of the EU EOM observer group.</narrative>
  </description>
